{"t_ms": 18410265, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s4_043", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Wi-Fi Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nComplimentary high-speed Wi-Fi is available throughout the hotel for all registered guests. Guests can connect using the network GrandHorizon_Guest and enter the access credentials provided during check-in. For technical assistance or connectivity issues, guests may contact the Front Desk at any time.", "Room Amenities Guide\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery guest room is equipped with complimentary Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a smart television, electronic safe, telephone, minibar, tea and coffee-making facilities, bottled drinking water, premium toiletries, fresh towels, and a hairdryer. Additional amenities such as an iron, ironing board, or extra pillows can be requested through housekeeping.", "Meeting & Conference Rooms\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel offers fully equipped meeting rooms and conference halls suitable for business meetings, training sessions, and corporate events. Facilities include projectors, audio-visual equipment, wireless internet, and customizable seating arrangements. Advance booking is recommended to ensure availability."], "scores": [0.7334810495376587, 0.8459732532501221, 0.9922195672988892], "filenames": ["43_wifi.txt", "14_room_amenities.txt", "45_meeting_rooms.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 40, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
